---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ToVerify from '../../components/ToVerify.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Water & Sewer"
  description="Water service in the Village of Midvale is now provided by Aqua Ohio. Storm sewer and drainage are village-managed."
  eyebrow="Services"
  intro="Water service is now provided by Aqua Ohio. This page explains who handles what."
>
  <div class="bg-warning/10 border-l-4 border-warning rounded p-4 mb-8">
    <p class="m-0 text-body text-ink">
      <strong>Heads up:</strong> If you're trying to start, stop, or pay for water
      service, contact <strong>Aqua Ohio</strong>, not the Village.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="bg-white border border-stone rounded-card p-6 mb-8 overflow-x-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-h3 text-primary mt-0">Who to call for what</h2>
    <table class="w-full text-body">
      <thead>
        <tr class="text-left border-b-2 border-stone">
          <th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Issue</th>
          <th scope="col" class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Who handles it</th>
          <th scope="col" class="py-2 font-semibold">Contact</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="border-b border-stone">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4">Water billing, service start/stop, repairs</td>
          <td class="py-3 pr-4">Aqua Ohio</td>
          <td class="py-3"><a href="https://www.aquawater.com/about-us/our-states/ohio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aquawater.com (Ohio)</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-stone">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4">Storm sewer, street drainage, catch basins</td>
          <td class="py-3 pr-4">Village Streets Department</td>
          <td class="py-3"><a href="/contact/?topic=report">Report an issue</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="py-3 pr-4">Sanitary sewer service</td>
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 italic">Pending verification</td>
          <td class="py-3"><a href="/contact/">Contact village</a></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <ToVerify note="The Aqua Ohio customer service phone number for the Midvale service area should be added here once verified." />

  <div class="prose-village max-w-prose">
    <h2>Why this changed</h2>
    <p>
      In August 2024, the Village entered into an Asset Purchase Agreement with
      Aqua Ohio to transition the village's water utility. The transition closed
      in Q1 2025.
    </p>
    <p>
      For a complete FAQ about the transition, see
      <a href="/resources/utility-transition/">Utility Transition</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
